{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0264","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0264:0000010a:text","row":36083,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"帰路を歩く。","en":"I walked the road home.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900848","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4005:00001","en":"Walking on the road home.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0264:00000136:text","row":36084,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"「うーむ」","en":"“Hmm.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900849","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4005:00002","en":"Taichi: \"Mmmh-hmm.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0264:00000158:text","row":36085,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"結局、何もない一日を過ごしてしまった。","en":"In the end, I'd spent another day with nothing happening.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900850","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4005:00003","en":"In the end, one whole day passed with nothing done.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0264:00000196:text","row":36086,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"どうも身が入らない。","en":"I just couldn't focus.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900851","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4005:00004","en":"Somehow I just wasn't into things.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0264:000001c2:text","row":36087,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"それに……学校に行っても賑やかさは感じられない。","en":"Besides... even at school, nothing felt lively.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900852","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4005:00005","en":"Besides... I might have gone to school, but I cannot feel its bustling liveliness.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["tense_aspect","logical_relation"],"assessment":"The Japanese says that even when he goes to school, he cannot feel any liveliness. The English turns his actual attendance into an uncertain past possibility.","remedy":"Besides... even when I go to school, I can't feel any liveliness there.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":38,"start":11,"text":"I might have gone to school"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0264:0000020a:text","row":36088,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"世界はガラスキになっている。","en":"The world had emptied out.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900853","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4005:00006","en":"The world had become almost entirely uninhabited.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0264:0000023e:text","row":36089,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"八人では世界とは言えない。","en":"Eight people weren't enough to call it a world.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900854","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4005:00007","en":"With eight people one cannot call it a world.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0264:00000270:text","row":36090,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"永遠の一夏。","en":"An endless summer.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900855","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4005:00008","en":"A single eternal Summer...","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0264:00000294:text","row":36091,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"俺たちは、時の渦にとらわれた人類の残骸なんだろうか。","en":"Were we all that remained of humanity, trapped in a vortex of time?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900856","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4005:00009","en":"We might just be the wreckage of mankind caught in the swirl of an eddy of time.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0264:000002e8:text","row":36092,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"「……」","en":"“...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900857","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4005:00010","en":"Taichi: \"...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0264:00000308:text","row":36093,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"わからなかった。","en":"I didn't know.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900858","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4005:00011","en":"I did not understand.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0264:00000330:text","row":36094,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"わかるはずがなかった。","en":"There was no way I could have known.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900859","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4005:00012","en":"There was no expectation I could understand.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]}]}
